  "translation": "Na Yehu, pikinini bilong Hanani, man i lukim ol visen, i kam aut long ren bilong em, i tok long king Yehoshafat: Yu save helpim ⟨את⟩ man i wokim rong, na yu save laikim ol man i birua long Yahwe? Na bilong dispela samting, kros i stap antap long yu, i kam long pes bilong Yahwe.",
